user autonomic_robot
topic read factory/secure/orders
topic read factory/secure/control
topic write robot/secure/status
topic write robot/secure/events
topic write robot/secure/lift_command
topic read robot/secure/aux_status

user autonomic_auxiliary
topic read robot/secure/lift_command
topic write robot/secure/aux_status

user autonomic_dashboard
topic write factory/secure/orders
topic write factory/secure/control
topic read robot/secure/status
topic read robot/secure/events
